    "Cancellation requires verified partner coverage and exact approval.",
    "Use adaptive native safe areas and fonts, not fixed web dimensions.",
    "Budget editing uses one reviewed component per save, captures its original version, and includes a native saved-category selector and historical limits. This prevents partial saves and silent overwrites during sync.",
